    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Rivals is a couch co-op chaotic vehicular sports game with bouncy physics:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Note: at least <strong>two controllers</strong> are required for <strong>local multiplayer </strong>and all game interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the best experience, we recommend playing <strong>Local Coop</strong> or <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> if you have stable internet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebound Rivals can support matches of 2 to 4 players in a <strong>1v1</strong> or <strong>2v2 </strong>format respectively<strong>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air Cannon Momentum Movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off everything!!! Including your opponent</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable Vehicles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several Power-ups</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Rivals is a couch co-op chaotic vehicular sports game with bouncy physics:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Note: at least <strong>two controllers</strong> are required for <strong>local multiplayer </strong>and all game interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the best experience, we recommend playing <strong>Local Coop</strong> or <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> if you have stable internet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebound Rivals can support matches of 2 to 4 players in a <strong>1v1</strong> or <strong>2v2 </strong>format respectively<strong>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air Cannon Momentum Movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off everything!!! Including your opponent</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable Vehicles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several Power-ups</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Blast into action with your trusty air cannon with gameplay inspired by Air Hockey and additions like traps and power-ups. Play with your friends in the classic game or go all out in the destructive chaos mode where you have more than your opponent to worry about.",
